Added branch-prediction hints and hoisted the profile pointer so the common valid-type path falls straight through. This keeps the hot path minimal while making the rare profile lookup path more compact.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    if (__builtin_expect(type == FIT_UINT8_INVALID, 0))
    {
        const Profile* p = profile;
        if (__builtin_expect(p == NULL, 0) ||
            __builtin_expect(profileIndex >= p->numFields, 0))
            return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;

        return p->fields[profileIndex].type;
    }

    return type;
}
```